WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.860
- Stop eating these foods

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.550
as they can not only make you sick,

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:06.620
but if not prepared properly,
poison you to death.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:07.970
Stay tuned till the end of this video

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:10.060
to also see what food you're not eating

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.560
that you definitely should be.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.270
Appleseeds, no it's not
cause an apple a day

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:16.630
keeps the doctor away.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.400
It's because apple
seeds contain amygdalin,

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.240
a compound that's broken down
by your gut into cyanide.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.900
That's why they actually taste bitter.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.930
Cyanide is actually a poison
that hurts your blood's ability

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:32.070
to carry oxygen leading to
hypoxemia and eventually death.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:33.020
Good news though,

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:35.800
your body can actually break
down small amounts of cyanide

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.660
and you'd have to eat hundreds
or even thousands of seeds

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:39.980
to be at risk for poisoning.

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:41.670
Fugu or puffer fish.

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:44.450
As seen in movies, puffer
fish in the dish prepared

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:46.000
can be extremely poisonous.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.680
The ovaries, intestines and liver of fugu

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:51.600
contain tetrodotoxin,
which is a neurotoxin

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:55.400
that's up to 1200 times
more deadly than cyanide.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.760
Fugu chefs must undergo years of training

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:00.020
to obtain a proper preparing license.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:01.460
And despite these precautions,

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.540
numerous people still die
every year from their fugu

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.920
being improperly prepared.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.100
This puffer poisoning

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.900
usually results from consumption
of incorrectly prepared

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.130
puffer soup called fugu chiri,

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:14.030
or occasionally from raw puffer meat

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:15.360
known as sashimi fugu.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:16.850
If it's not correctly prepared,

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:18.810
fugu can paralyze your nervous system

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:20.700
and shut down your respiratory muscles,

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:23.650
meaning this fish can cause you to drown

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:25.400
when you're not even in the water.

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:27.760
Rhubarb, rhubarb is a plant whose stock

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:30.970
is often used in pies, muffins, cakes.

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:33.570
And although rhubarb is
botanically a vegetable,

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.200
it's classified as a fruit
here in the United States.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.350
Their leaves contain high
levels of oxalic acid,

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:41.410
which is a corrosive and acidic substance

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:43.680
that can lead to kidney
failure and even death.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:46.890
And I stress high levels
because other healthy vegetables

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:49.940
like broccoli and spinach
also have oxalic acid

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:51.440
and they're just fine for us.

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:53.940
Don't use this as an excuse
to skip out on your veggies.

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:55.890
It's surely the dose
that makes the poison.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:58.690
Actually a wild story is
that during World War I

00:01:58.690 --> 00:02:00.740
when vegetable stock was real low,

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:03.170
the leaves were mistakenly
recommended as a food source

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:07.380
in Britain, leading to
poisonings and even deaths.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:10.590
Elderberries, I admit
elderberries are delicious

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:13.730
and actually not poisonous
if cooked and ripe,

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:15.390
but the rest of the tree they grow on

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:18.210
including its twigs,
leaves, roots and seeds

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:22.180
contain bitter alkaloids that
produce hydrocyanic acid.

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:24.960
If elderberries are fully
riped or strain properly

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:25.910
when they're processed,

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:27.490
they can cause nausea, vomiting,

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:29.180
and severe, severe diarrhea.

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:30.630
According to the CDC,

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:33.160
there was actually an
instance where eight people

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:35.490
attending a religious
ceremony in Monterey County

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:36.760
were airlifted to the hospital

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:39.890
after drinking a special
juice that had been made with,

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:42.720
among other things, elderberry
leaves and branches.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:43.840
They all survive,

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:46.800
but not before violently
violently vomiting,

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:48.970
just 15 minutes after drinking the juice.

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:51.830
Make sure you know who's making
your drinks and with what.

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:53.690
Red kidney beans,

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:56.720
actually a lot of legumes
can cause an upset stomach

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:58.500
when under cooked, but red kidney beans

00:02:58.500 --> 00:02:59.690
certainly take the cake

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:01.710
and that's because red kidney beans

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:04.300
contain a natural protein called lectin.

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:07.100
Within just a few hours of consuming PHA,

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:09.110
symptoms of nausea, vomiting, diarrhea,

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:10.470
and abdominal pain may appear.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:13.250
This PHA is the bean's
natural defense system

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.440
like our immune system, but rest assured,

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:17.840
as PHA is destroyed by proper preparation

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:21.160
and legumes are most definitely
a healthy source of protein

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:22.470
if properly prepared,

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.200
but it's not just a
matter of cooking them.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.160
In fact, according to the FDA,

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:28.150
cooking dried red kidney beans for less

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:29.780
than 10 minutes at any temperature

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:32.010
less than boiling can actually increase

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:35.220
the toxicity five fold
making them far more toxic

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:36.510
than if you just ate them raw.

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:38.470
Castor oil seeds or beans.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:41.760
Castor oil is notoriously known
for being used as a laxative

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:44.770
to help you poop, specifically
to stimulate laxative,

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:46.670
meaning that increases the
movement of the muscles

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:48.930
and the intestines helping
out with constipation.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:50.840
However, if you watch
the show Breaking Bad,

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:52.460
or my reaction to the show,

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:56.020
you know that the deadly
poison ricin shown on the show

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:58.360
is made by crushing castor seeds.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.600
It is reassuring to know
that to make castor oil

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:01.440
from the seeds,

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:03.810
we use heat during the
oil extraction process

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.660
to actually destroy the toxin.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:08.840
Lychee, lychee sangria, lychee martini,

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:10.500
lychee ice cream, yum.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.290
Lychees are delicious
and are a hydrating fruit

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:15.910
that have many health
benefits if eaten correctly

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:16.920
and in moderation.

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:20.420
But if you're eating raw,
green, unripened lychees

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:21.660
on an empty stomach,

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:24.290
that can prove to be extremely
dangerous to your health.

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:26.900
For 20 years, doctors
observed an alarming trend

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:29.430
in the Northern region of
India, where every spring,

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:32.320
hundreds of children would
randomly have seizures,

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:35.480
slip into comas, dying
in 40% of the cases.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:38.280
Failed test after failed test later,

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:41.880
scientists finally determined
that the underfed children

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.810
were eating unripened lychees
that fell to the ground

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:47.060
and they contain high levels
of a naturally occurring

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:49.680
amino acid derivative called hypoglycin.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:52.600
This caused the children to
wake screaming in the night

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.450
before suffering convulsions
and losing consciousness

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:57.970
as they suffered acute
swelling of their brains.

00:04:57.970 --> 00:04:59.470
Luckily since this discovery,

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:01.740
incidents from unripened lychees in India

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.020
have fallen to under 50 a year.

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:07.070
Nutmeg, get this, the
delicious little bit of nutmeg

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:10.860
that you add to your pasta,
eggnog and sauces may be yummy,

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:14.590
but over ingesting the
spice can actually be fatal.

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:17.400
Nutmeg contains a compound
called myristicin,

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:19.910
a psychoactive substance
that in larger doses

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:23.000
can actually poison your
system and cause organ failure.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:25.260
Myristicin is actually cytotoxic,

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.400
meaning that it instructs your own cells

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:28.790
to destroy themselves.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:31.450
In fact, just eating two,
three teaspoons of nutmeg

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:32.560
can result in seizures,

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.300
irregular heartbeat, nausea, dizziness,

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.980
dry mouth, pain and hallucinations,

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.630
similar to the ones people
get when taking peyote.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:43.180
I still remember my med
school toxicology professor

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:46.710
sharing that nutmeg is
metabolized into MMDA in the body

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.880
to produce hallucinogenic effects

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:51.650
and as a result has
romantically and historically

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:53.580
been linked as a
potential way to get high.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.330
Trust me though, this is
a horrible, horrible idea

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:58.720
as the vomiting and toxicity make it

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:00.930
a terrible recreational drug.

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:03.490
There are also no known current antidotes

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:05.880
for myristicin poisoning
and treatment focuses

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:08.440
on symptom management and
airway protection only.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:11.560
Potatoes, potatoes are
not poisonous in the way

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:13.800
that we usually consume them so relax,

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.750
but if you consume a green potato

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.460
or even one with a greenish tint,

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:20.050
it likely means that a
glycol alkaloid poison

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:21.840
named solanine is also present.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:25.670
This is an actual nerve toxin
that can result in vomiting,

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:27.950
diarrhea, paralysis, and even death

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:29.700
if ingested in very high amounts.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:31.990
Also, you know those
little sprouts and stems

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:34.850
that we commonly refer to as
eyes that grow on potatoes?

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:37.910
As they age, they contain
the same glycol alkaloid.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:40.400
So don't eat the stems,
don't eat green potatoes

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.580
and remember just because
potatoes are technically

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:43.700
a vegetable doesn't mean

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:46.540
they can replace your broccoli
at dinner, I'm watching you.

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:48.970
Cashews, did you know that unlike money,

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:51.040
cashews do grow on trees

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:53.250
and you probably have
seen me eat raw cashews

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.810
on this channel as a
snack, but truth be told,

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.430
they're not actually wrong.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:58.730
And thank God for that

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:02.570
as cashews have to be
heat-treated to move urushiol,

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:04.100
which is a poisonous chemical.

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:05.340
It's actually the same chemical

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:07.210
that causes a poison ivy rash.

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:10.020
Consuming truly raw cashews
straight from the tree

00:07:10.020 --> 00:07:11.940
can cause skin rashes and extreme,

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:14.190
sometimes fatal, allergic reactions.

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:17.580
Now for the one that you're
supposed to eat, kiwi skin.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.650
Some of you may not like its texture,

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:22.680
but health benefit
wise, it's really solid.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:25.150
The skin contains nutrients
like fiber, folate,

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.700
vitamin C and E.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:28.080
Adding the skin of the kiwi

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:31.270
boosts the fruit's fiber content by 50%.

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:33.620
And as someone who's
struggling to get my fiber,

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:36.250
the furry skin texture may
be worth the trade off.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:37.880
However, as a little word of warning,

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:39.840
if you have a tendency
to develop kidney stones,

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:42.860
you may want to look elsewhere
for your antioxidant.

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:44.880
Which is healthier,
real meat or fake meat?

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:46.530
Click here to find out and as always,

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:48.143
stay happy and healthy.

